{#- The banner, linking home. Included by base.njk on every page, and by
    content/unstrung/app/index.njk on the web app's page in place of the app's
    own copy, so the site's banner is the same everywhere. Styled by
    assets/css/header.css. tabindex="0" puts the link in Safari's tab order; see
    main-menu.njk.

    The alt text is the link's name, so it is what a screen reader reads when
    the banner gets focus. Joel's wording, 2026-11-21. The SVG's own title and
    desc are not read through an <img>.

    Keep it under 100 characters. NVDA's browse mode splits text longer than
    its line length, 100 by default, and read the second part as a separate
    graphic. This is 95. -#}
    <header class="site-header">
      <a class="banner" href="/" tabindex="0"><img src="/assets/images/banner.svg" alt="eyesunstrung banner: unstrung guitar sitting on its side on a table, sunglasses below the neck." width="1200" height="240"></a>
    </header>
